WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.741
Well, here we are.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.352
Sounds like the whole rest of the fleet

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:23.857
went down south to Chatham.  
We’re sticking close to home though

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:46.479
We started using the stand up rod last
year and it's been pretty lucky for us.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:50.383
It's a bit different than fighting
a Bluefin with our stationary rods,

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.753
but because it's not connected to the boat
while we're hooked

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:56.856
up, we have a lot more control
during the fight.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.324
I’m just going to throw
 it in the water.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.927
It's using much lighter weight line.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:05.865
So when we do hook up, we have to be much
more careful that we don't lose it.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.801
Well, I drove the boat here

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:09.903
and the boys slept.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.371
They got rested up.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.338
Now we're going to switch.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:12.939
I'm going to leave it

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:16.643
up to the boys to catch a fish,
which I know they can do just fine.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.813
And I'm going to go lay down and hopefully

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:21.915
they'll get me up
screamin with the fish on.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:25.318
All right. Good luck, guys.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.657
Did you take out our live, herring?

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:32.892
Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.735
Up. Up up, there he is!

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.276
Oh there we go!
We’re on!

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.413
We’re on!
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.583
Bell’s day!

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.885
Okay, I'll dig it up.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:01.154
We got a shooter on here

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.756
on a stand up

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:09.462
holding the road the whole time.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.598
Well, the other guys took the 
big long ride.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:16.903
And we decided to fish local
and fish the lake here.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:18.838
And so far it's working out good.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.807
The plans coming together,

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:23.510
you know, you don't have to go 100 miles
to catch tuna fish.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:25.044
You just need confidence

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.680
in fishing in your own backyard
and picking your own tomatoes.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:31.751
Just like we had hoped guys getting a bite
while I was laying down.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:35.221
Now all we get to do
is get them in the boat.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.691
We definitely know it’s a tuna,
but we're not too sure.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.126
On size just yet.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.695
got to get a little closer to be sure.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:46.366
It's another good keeper.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:48.468
Hopefully it is.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.869
Yeah. It's definitely a challenge.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:50.703
Fighting it this way.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:54.574
You really feel it in your legs
with this harness,

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:57.177
but you do get to control the
fish a little bit better.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.412
I feel definitely pretty cool.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:02.782
All the West Coast guys
do it over in California this way.

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.785
So fighting a Bluefin on 
the east coast like this.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.254
It's pretty cool if we can land em.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.323
I see him down there

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.393
That’s a keeper
That’s a keeper

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:16.729
Yeah. Definite keeper 
Jay back up to him. 

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:17.997
He’s turning
He’s turning

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:19.699
his heads towards me.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:21.301
That right you just focus on
you Jay.

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.735
I got this.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.939
Don’t worry we’ll get him.

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:28.274
Good job Joe.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.476
How do you like me now?

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.111
Coming over with the gal gaff.

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.680
All right, my left side right now.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.649
Removing the harpoon.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.218
I’ll get that out of your left side.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:40.053
Yeah, I got to.
Jay I don't want to hit you. Yep.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.721
Okay clipped. Yup.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:44.190
All right. Hang on.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.159
Yeah, it's a big one.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:48.061
I got him. Yeah.

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.395
All right, 
Get a hold like this.

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:50.463
This is a nice one.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:50.930
Hold it.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.233
Yeah.

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.601
Good job, guys.

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:58.471
Stuck with the plan
Stuck with the plan

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:00.106
Well done.

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.507
Well done, boys.

